  "goodToKnow": "Hetzen means to rush (Ich bin den ganzen Tag gehetzt), to chase, as with hounds, and to stir up hatred: gegen Ausländer hetzen. Die Hetze means both frantic haste and hate campaigning. Die Volksverhetzung, inciting hatred against groups, is a crime under § 130 of the German criminal code, which also covers Holocaust denial. When you mean to rush, the perfect takes sein if movement is involved: Ich bin zum Zug gehetzt."
